# Event-Driven Architecture Rules (RabbitMQ)

## 🔐 Service Boundaries (BẮT BUỘC)
- Database per service (KHÔNG share DB)
- KHÔNG gọi trực tiếp DB của service khác
- Services giao tiếp qua RabbitMQ

## 📡 Communication Rules
| Loại | Khi nào |
|------|---------|
| RabbitMQ | Async, multiple consumers |
| REST (via Gateway) | Query data cần ngay |

## 📦 Event Schema (BẮT BUỘC)
```json
{
  "event_id": "uuid",
  "event_type": "question.created",
  "event_version": 1,
  "aggregate_type": "question",
  "aggregate_id": "uuid",
  "source": "Question_Service",
  "occurred_at": "2026-07-23T10:00:00.000Z",
  "trace_id": "uuid",
  "data": {}
}
```

## 🐰 Queue Configuration
- Exchange: `examora.topic` (topic)
- Routing keys: `user.created`, `exam.created`, `question.created`, etc.
- Consumer queues: `email.send`, `notification.send`, `domain.events`

## 📐 Event Naming (Past tense)
- `user.created`, `user.updated`
- `exam.created`, `exam.updated`, `exam.completed`
- `question.created`, `question.updated`

## 🚫 CẤM
- ❌ Service gọi trực tiếp DB service khác
- ❌ Shared database
- ❌ Sync chain (A → B → C)
- ❌ Publish passwords, tokens trong events

